        <headline>Dense Fog Advisory issued September 25 at 5:56AM CDT until September 25 at 11:00AM CDT by NWS Rapid City SD</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Visibility one quarter to one half mile in dense fog.

* WHERE...Mellette, Todd, and Tripp.

* WHEN...Until 11 AM CDT this morning.

* IMPACTS...Low visibility could make driving conditions hazardous.
</description>
        <instruction>If driving, slow down, use your headlights, and leave plenty of
distance ahead of you.</instruction>
